  4568	## D414 · 2026-11-10 · Code sets the due day of a year's figure whose day is an estimate
  4569	
  4570	- **Asked:** "同一道“年报里的数字”题，模型三次估的到期日常差几天（比如 2 月 24 日和 2 月 28 日），34 道题里只有 18 道三次一致，你定的线是九成。年度数字题的到期日由谁定？"
  4571	  - Options: code sets it (recommended): "公司财年结束后 60 天（美国大公司年报的法定期限）、行业日历年结束后 90 天（约定值）。回放结果 34 道里 32 道一致。代价：公司年报类的题比模型估的日子晚约一个月结案；行业数据偶尔可能比 90 天更晚；不是整年的数字（滚动 12 个月的调查、季度数）不能套这条规则，要先单独处理。"; as now (the test still fails under line 6 and the work stays at this step).
  4572	  - Alex: "由程序统一定 (Recommended)".
  4573	- **Decided:** for a figure that covers one year and whose due day the model would estimate, code sets the day: the company's
  4574	  fiscal year-end plus 60 days for a company's figure, the calendar year-end plus 90 days for a theme's figure. A day the topic
  4575	  or the item states is kept. A figure that is not a year's (a survey's rolling twelve months, a quarter) is not given a day by
  4576	  this rule and is dealt with first, on its own. The costs he was shown: a company's annual figure closes about a month after
  4577	  the day the model expects it; an industry figure may come later than 90 days.
  4578	- **Evidence behind the question:** `clean-arch/step4-2026-11-10/stage_a/result-2/due-day-rule-60-90.txt`.
  4847	## D436 · 2026-11-13 · One bet seen from two sides is one question; change 3 is dropped; G1-a and G1-b run without it
  4848	
  4849	- **Asked**, after two blind source readers agreed on none of six cases (`clean-arch/step1-diagnosis-2026-11-12/gate1/PREREAD-RESULT.md`):
  4850	  "例子：同一篇文章里有'2027 年 HBM 出货增长多少'和'2027 年 HBM 是否仍然供不应求'。两位读者对照原文判：一位说这是两个能分别押注的题，另一位说是同一件事的两面，放一张卡就够。…你怎么看：这类情况应该算一个题还是两个题？"
  4851	  - Options: one question, change 3 dropped (recommended): "第二件事作为同一题的背景留着（后面判断时显示为'不判'），第三处改动作废。理由：都是同一个押注的不同侧面；我们的原则是偏谨慎、不要把一件事拆成碎题。"; two questions, change 3 continues; case by case.
  4852	  - Alex: "算一个题，第三处不改 (Recommended)".
  4853	- **Asked:** "第三处停下后，这两处的小测试（42 次发送，约 0.6 美元，上限 2 美元）要不要照常跑？" Options: run (recommended): "这两处不依赖第三处。任何一项不过就停，报给你。"; wait. Alex: "照常跑 (Recommended)".
  4854	- **Decided:** a second side of the same bet (the shortage beside the shipments, the AI-chip share beside the chip total, the capacity keeping pace beside the demand) is one question; it stays as context in that question and is shown as not judged (D397). Change 3 (the `outcome` definition) is dropped, and the "two bets in one thesis" class is closed as not a Step 1 defect under this ruling. G1-a and G1-b run as fixed in `COMBINED-PLAN.md`; the candidate for later gates is c8 with changes 1 and 2 only.
  4855	- **Scope:** clean Step 1; c8 stays in force.

